# Google Maps Platform API Key for Vue + Vite client-side usage
# Copy this file to .env.local and replace the placeholder with your own key.
#
# Quickstart (Zero-billing prototyping with Maps Demo Key):
# 1. Open: https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted
# 4. Generate/reveal your Demo Key and copy it below into .env.local
#
# Production Setup:
# - Obtain a key from https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# - Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Geocoding API, Weather API,
#   Air Quality API, Pollen API, and Solar API.
# - Restrict your key by HTTP referrer and API restrictions before deploying.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
